{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "d9bbbc810edcdc325696ad0744064c21d02921a01637decc2b35e8fcd514b71b", "ja": "舞台袖にて　～ファンのみんなへお中元～", "zh": "舞台侧边　～给各位粉丝的中元礼品～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "59b144f2bc65ae65ae061d063ab7eeb16d86eb771ad7892646ea50cc8b25ecba", "ja": "盛り上がる歓声にワクワクする春香達。\nファンにもらった気持ちを、ライブで返そう\nと気合いが入る。\n真心を込めた歌を届けるため、アイドル達は\nファンの待つステージへと向かう。", "zh": "听到会场内热烈的欢呼，春香等人兴奋不已。\n众人干劲十足，决定要以演唱会来回报粉丝的\n心意。为了将蕴含真心的歌曲送给观众，\n偶像们前往粉丝所等待的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "91d99fb17d3a4a038aa1ce03e5b6a4fa31a1aaa17fc52e24ac3c9f9777fa0381", "ja": "お～、お客さんがいっぱいですね～。\nみなさんの声で、身体がビリビリしますよ～♪", "zh": "哦～好多观众呢～\n听到大家的声音，身体就像被电到一样麻麻的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "81a95c6f26f3a09b3ac0e2c1538673b87d3079214e4948882f56ba1725ef2af6", "ja": "ほんと、すごい歓声だよね～。\nいつ聞いてもビックリしちゃうなぁ。", "zh": "真的，好热烈的欢呼声喔～\n不论何时听到都很惊人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "969e63c5a2b623e0eda24da77474537e745408ce8e090a2c0e0abdc5022e427a", "ja": "でも、なんだかワクワクもしてくるよね♪", "zh": "不过，也有一种令人兴奋的感觉对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "b351c502a8fec84e224ad4f54c83269cd87578773596ce7cee017af1b2cfbd93", "ja": "そうだよね！　レッスンしてる間は、ちゃんと全部\n覚えてうまくできるか、心配になったりもするけど。", "zh": "就是啊！虽然练习的时候，\n还很担心能不能全部记住并好好表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "0b24ba5349b1a1365acd338f249721d2731b0cc00ab732232db322534bea236e", "ja": "ここまで来て、みんなの声を聞くと……\nやるぞー！って、燃えてくるよねっ！", "zh": "不过一来到这里，听到大家的声音……\n就觉得斗志燃烧，干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "87979e14f1d186398599cae5bac76f2be64e79bd49ade44e9337b61bd8d31a2b", "ja": "……私たちはいつも、ファンの皆様に\n励ましていただいているのですね。", "zh": "……我们总是受到粉丝的鼓励呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1bd7e24df8c4f4bd603083cd2446d28e3d8c306f2a00f5b6d74f83c5075fbdd9", "ja": "ステージに上がる前も、上がった後も、いつも……。\nでは、きちんとお返しをしなくてはいけません。", "zh": "不论上台前，还是上台后，一直都是……\n那么，就必须好好回报他们才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "73c1d1f7b82796db8c5620440dd651defc175713b1b412bdfdf270fcec083112", "ja": "そうだね。私達がもらった気持ちを、\n何倍にもして！　ライブでお返ししようね♪", "zh": "没错，用演唱会把我们收到的心意\n乘上好几倍还回去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "a06dc18210760267721ab7cecfa351e96ac81087b22b05099d936623ee19a55c", "ja": "なるほど～。つまりライブは、\nファンのみなさんへのお中元なんですね～。", "zh": "原来如此～换句话说，\n演唱会就是给粉丝的中元礼品呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "a54dc5954c9ba53780b3c8d84a8bd2a1621ad0c4cf56fb1f62d6610c7e78d08e", "ja": "お中元かぁ……。あはは、そうかもね！\n感謝の気持ちを伝えたい、って意味では同じかも。", "zh": "中元礼品啊……哈哈哈，也许喔！\n在「表达感谢」这点上，或许是一样的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "aa9973f134068573a396f1504b4ee8a6fbbb23632146644ea4a0f90ca5dcce7d", "ja": "それじゃ、みんな！　ボクたちの真心を込めた\nご挨拶のプレゼント、届けにいく準備はできてる？", "zh": "那么大家！\n准备好去送满载我们真心的问候礼物了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "0f997f5b876f46a1ed570c4bb4b0970fa7297ffa796b3d7e41afa5aaa045ca8b", "ja": "もちろんですよ～。お昼寝もしましたし、\nご飯もたくさん食べましたし、バッチリです～。", "zh": "当然啰～我睡了午觉，\n也吃了好多饭，已经做好万全准备了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "adfcaf1b1c6dc10a90324867dbee36188c20b8af8bd3d2f1e583aabe0990d6d0", "ja": "これまでいただいた温もりを歌に乗せて……\n全て皆様に届けます！", "zh": "将我们至今收到的温暖融入歌曲里……\n送给全部的粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0092_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_09_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "3cab027e72e0df7b0ee76f9cd6db1df0d4f3791ce334fd1d55f4234e317e8e2d", "ja": "それじゃ、行こう！　みんなが待つステージに！\n一番後ろのお客さんまで、私達の歌を届けようね！", "zh": "那就走吧！前往大家等待的舞台！\n让我们的歌声传达到最后一排的观众那吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
